    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>BOXBOYMAN</i>. Don\u2019t overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: receive, drive, deliver, repeat. The packages? Fragile. The clock? Yes. The dogs? Yearn for cardboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play through is procedurally generated for your convenience and discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver everything without error and mostly intact, beat the timer, keep the van limping along, and you'll move on \u2014 to even more boxes.\u00a0It\u2019s a lifestyle. <i>It\u2019s a game.</i> It's you. It's me.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s BOXBOYMAN. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>BOXBOYMAN</i>. Don\u2019t overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: receive, drive, deliver, repeat. The packages? Fragile. The clock? Yes. The dogs? Yearn for cardboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play through is procedurally generated for your convenience and discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver everything without error and mostly intact, beat the timer, keep the van limping along, and you'll move on \u2014 to even more boxes.\u00a0It\u2019s a lifestyle. <i>It\u2019s a game.</i> It's you. It's me.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s BOXBOYMAN. </p>",
